# week07 · LJ 유체 템플릿 — 자리표시 {T} {seed} {dt} {steps} 는 render_inputs.py 가 채운다 (run_id = {run_id})
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
velocity all create {T} {seed} dist gaussian
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor 0.3 bin
fix 1 all nvt temp {T} {T} 0.5
timestep {dt}
thermo 50
thermo_style custom step temp press pe etotal
run {steps}
write_data final_{run_id}.data
